(window.StoryDialogue = window.StoryDialogue || {})["ev-4"] = {"560601100":[["","Warning! Warning!"],["UNCS Soldier","Report, Commander: Protective Wall 3 has sustained 70% damage. The 9th and 11th Mobile Squads assigned to guard it are not responding..."],["Laboratory Guard","Report! The medical unit transporting the wounded has come under attack! Requesting immediate support!"],["UNCS Captain","Damn it! The other mobile units are unreachable as well? Isn't there a single comms officer left out there?!"],["","3:52 AM. UNCS Central Command. The brightly-lit command center is ablaze with frenzied activity. Endless reports flow in, continuously sent to the command center through the few remaining communication lines."],["","On the central screen, red symbols spread across under countless tense gazes: \"Signal Lost\"... \"Signal Lost\"... \"Signal Lost\"... The shouts of commanders and officers echo throughout the hall."],["Natalia","Madam, Naomi's report is in. We can confirm that the current comms situation is not a Skynet attack. The frontline troops have most likely been subjected to physical interference."],["UNCS Military Officer","The DL. They're the only group on this island who have the capabilities for an attack of this kind."],["UNCS Military Officer","The current situation leaves no room for hesitation, Governor... Deploy the Falcon Force. The loss of the arashi mining platform on the northern island is not something we can afford."],["","In the corner of the command room, a group of high-ranking officials and officers are huddled together, whispering. As the front-line situation continues to deteriorate, their words grow increasingly heated."],["","In their midst, the newly appointed UNCS Viceroy to Milkhama, Rosemary Jean, sits silently in front of the communication projection, quietly listening to the statement from the other side."],["Lukmund","...That's basically the situation. Various DLAF units have also been affected by different levels of EMP... Investigators are already en route."],["Lukmund","However, I must also mention that despite the NDF's repeated incursions into the northern mining area recently, I still hope we can all exercise restraint at this critical moment."],["Rosemary","......"],["Rosemary","I also hope this incident has nothing to do with the DL..."],["Rosemary","I'll send my \"eyes\" to take a look personally."],["DL Soldier","Hey! Can you still hear me? Call... number... are you...?"],["???","Sorry, the unlucky guy who was piloting this hunk of metal has already passed out."],["???","I've left him in the bunker by the side of the road. If you're coming to pick him up, then... Hey, you still there?"],["DL Soldier","......"],["???","Busted again? Seriously? It's bad enough I had to end up in a place like this, but this thing looks like it belongs in a museum..."],["???","Let me see... These two handles are the control sticks, right? Next, pull the control pin, and then—"],["UNCS Soldier","Attention Dawnstar League vehicle ahead—drop your weapons and abandon your unit immediately... I repeat, drop your weapons and abandon your unit!"]],"560601301":[["Asuka","I've already told you! I have absolutely no memory of how I got here!"],["","Blazing white lights pour down from above in the UNCS ground camp's interrogation room. A girl in red sits across the long table, glaring defiantly at the woman opposite her."],["","The room is equipped with 360° surveillance and recording devices. A word, an inflection, a raised eyebrow or shift of posture—all is meticulously captured and sent to the archive."],["","Even though the atmosphere of the conversation so far has been serious throughout, and both the lie detector and psychological experts have deemed it to be \"truthful,\" the information obtained from the girl is hard to believe."],["Natalia","Sorry, Miss Asuka Shikinami Langley... We are not questioning the authenticity of your statements, but the things you mentioned... about \"Angels,\" \"EVAs\"..."],["Natalia","It's still not enough to convince us of your claim that you come from another world."],["","A rare wry smile appears on Natalia's face as she points to the interrogation records in front of her, trying to catch a flicker in the girl's eyes."],["","But Asuka's gaze remains as calm as ever, and Natalia has already anticipated that no matter how many times she asks such questions, Asuka will continue to respond in the same way."],["Asuka","Whether you believe it or not is up to you... It has nothing to do with me!"],["Asuka","They said they'd put down their weapons and show \"sincerity,\" but as soon as the cockpit opened, they rushed in without hesitation..."],["Natalia","I'm sorry for Ophelia's reckless behavior. It was not our intention to treat a guest so rudely."],["Natalia","However, disputes over the border, especially in the northern mining area, have intensified. We have to give special attention to all events and people that might cause unexpected incidents."],["Natalia","Especially individuals like you who can skillfully pilot STs without special training."],["Asuka","You mean what that Ophelia lady referred to as a \"test subject\" earlier?"],["Asuka","If Shinji and the commander's pet also ended up here, suspicion like this could put them in danger..."],["Natalia","Oh? Are those two people you mentioned your friends?"],["Asuka","I... *cough, cough* ...I do have a few so-called friends..."],["Asuka","But I don't know where they are now..."],["Natalia","Hmm... perhaps this is a good opportunity for us to truly show our sincerity..."],["Natalia","It might be an exaggeration to say this, but the GSA can indeed be called the greatest intelligence agency in the world..."],["Natalia","If you're willing to share more information about your companions, we might be able to help you find them."],["GSA Agent","Excuse me, Officer Accordion, there's an urgent message from the Madam."],["GSA Agent","There was a sudden intense disturbance on the surface of the Foren River, and the DL territory on the opposite side was bombed by what are suspected to be ST missiles..."],["GSA Agent","Please come to the command center immediately."]],"560602100":[["???","This smell... it's so unfamiliar..."],["???","The buildings, the walls... Everything around me..."],["???","Where is this place...?"],["","Amid crumbled ruins, a frail boy hugs his knees, curled alone in the rubble."],["","Everything before his eyes feels unfamiliar and dangerous. However, he can't remember how he got here."],["???","Asuka... Ayanami... Miss Misato..."],["???","Why... am I here...? Why...?!"],["Dean","Hey, kid! What are you squatting over there for?!"],["Dean","Hurry up and run! Get to the underground shelter before the next air raid!"],["","The voice booms like a broadcast through the wall above. The boy lifts his head, still lost in confusion."],["???","Air raid...? Shelter...? Huh? Is... Is he talking to me?"],["Dean","Damn, have they already caught up...?"],["Dean","Hey! Stop dawdling! Get going, now! Or else we'll—"],["","*BOOM——*"],["???","Waaah...!"],["","Before him, the already collapsed ruins are suddenly blasted open, with rubble and sand cascading down amidst the violent tremors. Sunlight from outside the ruins pierces the dark space like a sharp sword..."],["","The panicked and helpless boy instinctively raises his hand to shield himself, but a massive shadow has already moved in front of him."],["","At the other end of the ruins, a towering ST rises in the blast, smoke curling from its frame. Its emerald eyes flare open against the backlight, locking with the boy's."],["???","This... This is...!?"],["Dean","Seriously, how'd you find a hole like this to hide in? Even the animals in the zoo know to follow their keeper into the bunker..."],["Dean","Hey, you look about middle school age. You're a little runaway rebel, right?"],["???","I...I-I-I..."],["","The voice of a young man echoes from the ST's speakers. Behind it, countless rockets streak through the sky."],["","Clearly, this giant machine shielded him from death just now."],["???","Where... exactly is... this place...!?"],["Dean","Forget it. Questions can wait. We've got no time to chat!"],["Dean","Come on, climb up the rescue cable quickly! That big guy is already closing in on us, and if we don't get away now, we'll end up under the ruins!"],["???","I... understand... but... be careful—!"],["","Just as the hatch opens and the lifeline lowers, a rocket suddenly veers off course and slams into the ST."],["Dean","What!?"]],"560602301":[["","I'm sorry... In the end we still couldn't achieve our ideals, our hopes..."],["","Yes. In Milkhama, there was never any place for ideals. I only understood that at the very end..."],["","Here, there is only endless hypocrisy, endless greed, endless betrayal... and humans who exist like walking corpses after being engulfed by all these dreadful things."],["","Arashi ore forms a neural connection with living beings. On this island, the ore is tainted with desire itself..."],["","A world constructed from this, weapons with this at their core..."],["Hazy Voice","The patient... is getting weaker, prepare... for revival..."],["","Will it really bring peace and happiness?"],["Hazy Voice","Wake up... Shinji... Shinji...!"],["Shinji","Hurgh... Hah... Hah... Hah..."],["","The boy awakens abruptly, wincing from the piercing brightness of the hospital lights."],["","The continuous whispers in his ears suddenly vanish, leaving only the monotonous beeping of medical equipment..."],["Shinji","An unfamiliar... ceiling..."],["Shinji","Did I... have a nightmare...?"],["???","It seems the patient has woken up. Remove the braces and the ventilator..."],["Doctor","Yes, Professor."],["Shinji","Huff... huff... Did I just pass out?"],["???","You're lucky, kid—at least luckier than that guy who was riding with you. It's just a stress reaction from piloting an arashium ST for the first time."],["Shinji","Arashium... ST?"],["???","That's right, the first unit of the experimental REV series, the one you just piloted to escape the battlefield."],["???","I have to say... your talent is indeed outstanding. Many pilots have wanted to step into that REV-01, yet the arashi core rejected them all..."],["Shinji","Sorry... I really don't understand... what you're saying..."],["Ludwig","Oh, it's nothing, just some boring musings... Let me introduce myself, I'm Peter Ludwig. I'm the chief researcher of the DL Special Research Institute's Second Division..."],["Ludwig","You saved my laboratory and staff from that monster just now... Let's just say I'm here to thank you."],["Shinji","That... monster...?"],["","Suddenly, pain lances through his skull, and scenes from before replay in his mind."],["","After suddenly arriving in this world for reasons unknown, all he can remember are those ruins and the giant ST that appeared before him to block the missiles."],["Shinji","Ah, I remember now, Mr. Dean saved me..."],["Shinji","How is he!?"],["","Just as Shinji inquires about the safety of his savior, the door to the ward is suddenly pushed open."],["Doctor","It's bad! Professor, the patient in Room 2 is in critical condition. His AMC degree is dangerously high, and he's showing pronounced neurological symptoms. His consciousness is at risk of collapsing at any moment..."],["Ludwig","Another case... Got it. Moving out."],["","Without any hesitation or visible emotional fluctuation, Ludwig simply nods to Shinji and then quickly walks out of the room."],["","After this, only the beeping sound of the instruments operating remains in his ears..."],["Shinji","Mr. Dean..."],["","Tch ...It sounds like his injury's pretty bad. Are you sure it's that serious...?"],["","Seriously, where did that ST come from? I didn't know today's technology was capable of a beast like that!"],["","A familiar voice suddenly comes from one side of the hospital bed. The blue curtain used as a partition is lifted, and Dean, with bandages wrapped around his head, pokes his head out from behind the curtain."],["Shinji","Mr. Dean... you... you're here? You're actually okay!?"],["Dean","Hey, kid, you're in good spirits too. I almost thought you'd ended up like those other guys..."],["Dean","In the end, it turns out the two of us were the least injured in that chaos. Could it be because I operated that experimental machine?"],["Shinji","What's going on here...?"],["Dean","I've only heard bits and pieces from this hospital bed, but the situation's a mess."],["Dean","That monster ST that attacked us, you remember it, right? Two days ago, it suddenly emerged from the bottom of the Foren River and headed straight into DL territory. Line after line was set up along the way, but they could barely limit its advance..."],["Dean","Any ST directly hit by its weapons becomes irreversibly paralyzed, and the pilot also suffers varying degrees of arashi matter contamination..."],["Dean","The DLAF and the council held meeting after meeting, but to no avail. Likely they'll evacuate civilians and ready heavy weapons next..."],["Shinji","Really...?"],["Dean","By the way, kid... who are you exactly?"],["Dean","The locals fled long before the evacuation order. So how did you end up there?"],["Shinji","I..."],["Dean","Oh, I get it! Your parents must be researchers from the Special Research Institute's Second Division, and when that monster machine attacked, you got lost in those maze-like ruins, waiting for someone to rescue you..."],["Shinji","I... I'm sorry... I don't know why I was there either..."],["Shinji","\"DL,\" \"Arashium STs,\" \"Arashi Contamination\"—I've never heard of any of these things before... Everything here is completely different from the world I know..."],["Shinji","I... Why am I here...?"],["","Dean, usually so carefree, uncharacteristically turns serious. He scrutinizes the young man before him for a long time, then speaks with a frown."],["Dean","Judging by the bandages, it doesn't seem like there's anything wrong with your head... You actually being serious, kid?"],["Dean","Sounds like you crossed over from another world, like in those cartoons... but it's kind of hard to believe..."],["Shinji","I..."],["Shinji","I... don't know..."],["","Saying this, the boy hugs his knees and curls up at the head of the bed again."],["","The world he once lived in, the companions he once fought alongside, the reason he came to this world... It all feels like a recent dream, real yet without any answers."],["Dean","Speaking of which, your name's Shinji, right?"],["Shinji","Yes..."],["Dean","Hmm. Don't tell me I've been living under a rock. A boy who pilots like that is a certified prodigy. No way I wouldn't know your name."],["Dean","If you really came from another world... Shinji, did your world also have STs?"]],"560603100":[["Dean","Ahhh, I don't know whether to admire you or envy you! Piloting EVAs to protect all of humanity... It's something I could only ever dream of!"],["Dean","EVAs towering stories high, a massive city built underground, and Angels that could attack at any moment..."],["Dean","Damn it! Damn it! EVAs and all, I really wanna pilot one and see!"],["Shinji","Is... Is that right?"],["Dean","And why are you so lucky? In your world, being able to pilot an EVA is the rarest honor there is!"],["Shinji","Is this... luck?"],["Shinji","Being able to pilot an EVA... it isn't really like that..."],["Dean","And the comrades you mentioned who go on those missions with you..."],["Dean","Oh, right! What are the EVAs they pilot like? Did they come with you too?"],["Shinji","Asuka and Ayanami..."],["","In the ward, after listening to Shinji's description of the world, the DLAF's rising star, green with envy, scratches his head as he rolls back and forth on the hospital bed."],["","To him, Shinji's world—a world of giant humanoid weapons, the looming terror of Angels—is everything he ever dreamt of."],["","A world where all his childhood fantasies are real."],["","However, upon hearing Dean inquire about his companions, Shinji silently lowers his head, leaving Dean to pound his chest and ramble on incessantly beside him."],["Shinji","I... don't know..."],["","The boy buries his head in his legs again, as scenes from the past world and the horrors of the recent accident flash through his mind."],["","If they end up here as well, will they face the same danger he did? If the monstrous ST that attacked him earlier finds them too, what will become of Asuka and Ayanami?"],["Dean","Are you worried about them? I'm sorry..."],["Dean","I've never been good at reading the room..."],["Dean","But you really chose the wrong time to wind up here... The situation on Milkhama Island is so complicated right now, with constant friction between the two major forces... If your friends got sent here too, that could be a problem."],["Dean","Ah, I'm really sorry that a guest like you had to see our troubled world. As a soldier, I can't help but bear some of the responsibility."],["Shinji","No... it's nothing..."],["Shinji","You saved me back there. I'm actually... very grateful to you..."],["Dean","No need for thanks. If you hadn't carried me out in that ST, I'd be another corpse on the battlefield."],["Hardaway","Dean Knight, Shinji Ikari... Sorry to disturb your rest."],["","As they open up about the tough time they'd shared, the ward door abruptly slams open."],["Dean","Hardaway! Even you're here? Has it gotten that bad?"],["Hardaway","There's an emergency... The missing 9th Mobile Squad has sent back a message. \"Leviathan\" has appeared again."],["Dean","\"Leviathan\"? Is that the monster ST!?"],["Hardaway","...The 9th Mobile Squad found themselves in the same situation as you. They found a girl in the evacuation zone who hadn't gone to the shelter."],["Hardaway","And judging from the images sent back from the front, her outfit bears quite a striking resemblance to that of Shinji Ikari..."],["Shinji","...?"],["???","......"],["Shinji","Ayanami...!?"]],"560603301":[["DL Soldier","The survivors Shinji Ikari and Dean Knight of the Tenth Mobile have been missing over thirty minutes. High-explosive traces detected. Chances of survival... slim."],["DL Captain","Major, Second Mobile reports EM interference and high-density arashi particles near Leviathan's last sighting. Entering the central zone for rescue is extremely dangerous!"],["Hardaway","Impossible! The instruments must be broken. That level of density can't occur under normal conditions. Even labs rarely show readings like that!"],["Researcher","But... the same anomaly appeared in the cockpits destroyed earlier. We thought they were isolated cases."],["DL Captain","Should the rescue teams keep advancing? At this rate, a standard ST will last ten minutes before mutating like the others and becoming completely inoperable."],["DL Captain","And we still don't know the frontline situation. There may be other enemies waiting."],["Matilda","......"],["Matilda","Dean... Shinji..."],["Matilda","Did I... push too far after all...?"],["Hardaway","Our choices are limited, Matilda. We're not up against any ordinary enemy this time. I propose we report directly to the DLAF headquarters and request support from the local unit..."],["DL Staff Officer","But the previous directive was very clear. Our actions should avoid any aggressive implications to prevent direct conflict with the UNCS."],["Hardaway","So are we really just going to sit and wait, Officer...? You don't think the current situation is \"still under control,\" do you?"],["DL Staff Officer","Your perspective is a result of your lack of experience. You're already making a fuss after losing just half a squad... Do you know what level of event it takes to mobilize homeland forces?"],["Ludwig","Perhaps you'd hear my suggestion, Major Matilda... Set the fusion rail gun at the Thepia base five kilometers out. Fire an electromagnetic pulse at the arashi matter contaminated zone, then..."],["Ludwig","Utilize the electrolytic properties of arashi matter to launch an AMP that creates a specific frequency field, diluting the dispersed arashi particles in the area... Then let the rescue team proceed with the rescue operation..."],["Matilda","Professor Ludwig?"],["Matilda","Sorry... I didn't notice you there."],["Ludwig","I just arrived at the command center myself... Will you consider my plan? Time is of the essence."],["Hardaway","This is no time for jokes."],["Hardaway","Everyone knows the electrolytic properties of arashi matter, but we have no clue which frequency band to use for transmission in this situation!"],["Ludwig","What if I were to tell you the preset frequency band for the rail gun... Would you be willing to give it a try?"],["Matilda","What do you mean by that?"],["Ludwig","I just had a brief chat with the surviving patients and gathered some information from them."],["Ludwig","The mastermind behind this attack... might be an acquaintance of mine."]],"560604100":[["UNCS Captain","...Seven minutes ago, we detected a long-range electromagnetic missile launched from Thepia."],["Natalia","The target?"],["UNCS Captain","Not our territory. Roughly two kilometers south of the Foren River, in a DL town. Specific target unknown."],["GSA Operative","Our contacts received the same information. The DLAF did not try to hide this strike..."],["GSA Operative","Based on the intelligence currently available, the purpose of this strike is to rescue two pilots trapped in the town."],["GSA Operative","However, the recent deployments of the DLAF have been very chaotic, with many actions in both open and covert areas. It cannot be ruled out that this is a cover for some hidden agenda."],["Natalia","Since the accident in the northern mining area, such news has been frequent... It seems that the DL is somewhat overwhelmed."],["Natalia","Continue to follow up on this lead and investigate the true reason for the launch. If it is indeed for this supposed rescue, then we need to know who and why."],["Natalia","I don't believe they would go to such lengths for two ordinary pilots who got lost in the wilderness."],["GSA Operative","Got it!"],["Natalia","And... what about that girl named Asuka? Is she still staying put in the interrogation room?"],["GSA Operative","She... as you expected, has already found the \"flaw\" we set in the security door and slipped away."],["Natalia","She is indeed quite clever... In which direction did she escape?"],["GSA Operative","She should be near the temporary archive room on the third floor—probably overheard something during our previous conversation and wants to investigate for herself."],["GSA Operative","However, I still think the \"truth\" she told us before was far too absurd. If she really is some visitor from another world, just letting her go like this..."],["Natalia","Keep her caged and she'll never speak. Letting her hunt for herself may reveal more."],["Natalia","Let Ophelia keep an eye on her. Her purpose piques my curiosity as well..."],["Asuka","Huff... huff... This should be the archive room!"],["Asuka","Security here really is lax... Could it be some kind of trap?"],["Asuka","But for now, there's no time to worry about that..."],["","In the archives, the girl in red cautiously slips between rows of files while keeping an eye on her surroundings."],["","On the still-active terminal, the interface named \"Skynet\" displays various icons and information. Asuka quickly adapts, operating it with ease."],["","At Asuka's proficient touch, the files in Skynet unlock one by one, revealing information about Milkhama, arashi matter, the UNCS, and the DL before her eyes."],["","However, just as Asuka is about to search for entries related to \"time travel,\" the lights in the archives and the screen in front of her suddenly cut to black."],["","Whoa... Is this a power outage!?"],["Ophelia","You really think the power would go down in a command center that easily...?"],["","In the darkness, a familiar voice comes from the doorway."],["","Ophelia, holding a tactical flashlight, leisurely approaches Asuka in the corner."],["Asuka","You... You're that woman from before! So you planned to hunt me down from the start..."],["Ophelia","At least for now, I don't see any value in hunting you down... Asuka Shikinami Langley, right?"],["Ophelia","I'm very curious about your background."],["Asuka","Here we go again. I already told your superior about my background in the interrogation room. Whether you believe it or not is up to you."],["Ophelia","She's not my superior... As for you, I'm not interested in those trivial matters like Angels, EVAs, or special agencies protecting humanity. What I care about is your talent and ability to pilot STs."],["Ophelia","Interested in a rematch? I've specially arranged an experimental ST equipped with a human-computer Dive mode for you."],["Asuka","Huh? Are you saying... you want another fight?"],["","The sudden unreasonable request from the hostile woman catches Asuka completely off guard. She repeatedly scrutinizes Ophelia, but detects no trace of mockery."],["Asuka","I see, you're the type who needs to prove you're better than others to find your sense of worth..."],["Asuka","Unfortunately, I don't have much interest in playing that kind of game with you."],["Ophelia","I knew you'd refuse... But what if I told you we'd just confirmed that, across the river, the DL fired an electromagnetic missile, all for the sake of two lost pilots..."],["Ophelia","If they're the friends you mentioned earlier..."],["Asuka","My friends... You mean the commander's pet and that idiot Shinji? You aren't trying to trick me, are you...?"],["Ophelia","You think I'm bluffing? Try me. You'll soon find out."],["Ophelia","If you have no objections, come along. I'll take you to the underground hangar. I have a \"gift\" for you."]],"560604301":[["Asuka","What!? Are you saying that useless Shinji and the commander's pet were..."],["Rosemary","They were attacked by an unknown enemy near a town by the Foren River, and their status is currently unknown... Intel indicates that the DL has already dispatched several rescue teams, but there's no clear response yet."],["Asuka","......"],["Asuka","What... How could this happen...?"],["","In the UNCS interrogation room, Asuka hangs her head helplessly, the corners of the paper in her hand crumpled from her grip."],["","The report clearly presents information related to the rescue in Eastern Milkhama, and even an outsider like Asuka can clearly understand the implications."],["","A girl named Rei Ayanami was injured in battle, while her companions Shinji Ikari and DLAF member Dean Knight are comatose. Current condition unknown."],["Asuka","Idiot... You're such a big idiot!"],["Natalia","Although the authenticity of this report is yet to be verified, at least it's not a casualty notice... so there's no need to be too pessimistic for now."],["Natalia","And no matter how advanced the General Security Administration's intelligence system is, our information is always delayed to some extent."],["Natalia","Going to the DL may be your best shot at the truth."],["Ophelia","Using a kid worried about her friends as a plant—doesn't that feel a bit inhumane?"],["Ophelia","If we recklessly cross the border like this, the Dawnstar League won't just sit idly by."],["Natalia","You're exaggerating. I think this will be a rare opportunity for cooperation between the UNCS and this visitor from another world..."],["Natalia","Need time to think, Asuka?"],["Natalia","Go and personally confirm the safety of your friends while gathering some intel on the DL... Ophelia will do her utmost to assist you and watch your back along the way."],["Natalia","If you're lucky, you might find the reason you crossed into this world, and perhaps even a way to return home."],["Asuka","I'm going. If Shinji and that doll really pulled this stunt, well, I've been itching to knock some sense into them for a long time now."],["Asuka","But teaming up with this egomaniac..."],["Ophelia","Hmph. Spare me the honor of babysitting \"Her Highness.\""],["Ophelia","I come and go through DLAF lines as I please. Keep up with my pace—if you can."]],"560605100":[["Shinji","The smell is unfamiliar... the memories are unfamiliar too..."],["Shinji","But I... wasn't I already..."],["Shinji","Huh!? Where am I!?"],["","The azure waves crash against the rocks on the sea's surface, presenting a scene completely different from anything he has seen before."],["","Shinji Ikari is floating in mid-air above the sea, and below him, figures walk on the undulating surface like wandering spirits."],["???","You chase us even here, outsider?"],["???","You took our homeland, took our future, took our legacy..."],["???","Now you're even going to take away this last sanctuary?"],["Shinji","I... I don't understand what you're talking about... \"Homeland,\" \"future,\" \"legacy\"... I don't understand at all!"],["???","We have long grown tired of your rhetoric. Deceitful, treacherous, fickle..."],["???","You must pay for your actions, for your betrayal and deceit..."],["???","We will... take back... our... Milkhama!"],["Shinji","Wh-what?!"],["","Shinji Ikari suddenly feels his body lighten, falling from mid-air and then plunging into the water..."],["Shinji","*gulp, gulp* ...Ugh..."],["Shinji","Waaah!?"],["","Beneath the water's surface lie countless sunken, mountain-like piles of corpses. They are miners, mercenaries, machinists, researchers..."],["???","Feel our helplessness, our sorrow, our rage..."],["???","Your judgment has come, outsider... Drown in this despair."],["Shinji","*sob... sob, sob...*"],["Dean","You stuck-up morons! Don't think you can just drag people down with you!"],["","A familiar angry shout suddenly rises from the sea's surface, and a giant mechanical arm reaches into the water, accurately protecting Shinji as he struggles."],["Shinji","*splutter... cough, cough... cough, cough, cough...*"],["Dean","Stand up, Shinji! Imagine you can stand on the water, or pilot your ST..."],["Shinji","Mr. Dean!?"],["","Dean's ST stands firmly on the water's surface as if weightless. With one hand, it holds Shinji Ikari, who has just escaped from the water, and with the other, it gives Shinji a thumbs-up."],["Shinji","Mr. Dean, watch out!"],["","A white figure suddenly rushes toward Dean, and Shinji feels the force on his back loosen, falling toward the water once more."],["Shinji","Gah!"],["Dean","Chip up, Shinji! Imagine you're piloting an ST, holding a weapon, and about to fight a life-and-death battle with these underwater devils!"],["Dean","Shout in your heart \"Justice will prevail!\"... Hah!"],["","The moment Shinji is released, a massive polearm suddenly appears out of thin air in the Ranger's hand, swinging toward the incoming enemy."],["Shinji","An ST..."]],"560605301":[["Shinji","The ST and the enemy... both disappeared?"],["","The imposing ST vanishes in an instant under the crashing waves, leaving only a white silhouette standing amidst the parted sea."],["Lucas","Looks like I overslept... In theory, the passage between Leviathan and the outside world should be completely closed, so what are intruders doing here...?"],["Dean","Hey! I'm warning you—no funny stuff!"],["Dean","Whether it's you or those ghost STs, I'll take down as many as you've got!"],["Lucas","I have no doubt about your courage, Dean Knight... In some ways, I know you better than you know yourself."],["Lucas","But the memories of the young man next to you are much more complicated... Is he a human from another world, perhaps?"],["Dean","He summed us up at a glance! Who's this guy, a mind reader!?"],["Dean","You just said your name's Lucas Bonat, and you're the admin of this Leviathan, right?"],["Dean","OK, who exactly are you, what the hell is this place, and where did that rampaging ST outside come from? You'd better explain everything clearly!"],["Lucas","...With so many questions, it's probably impossible to explain everything all at once."],["Lucas","But since you've made it here, I might as well show you the truth..."],["Lucas","Prepare yourselves, guests, and don't lose yourselves in the upcoming illusion."]],"560606100":[["???","...Regarding those two unexpected survivors, you know what to do, right?"],["???","If you don't want the events of that year to be exposed, they cannot be allowed to live..."],["Ludwig","I'll find an opportunity to act, but not now."],["???","Hmph... You're not still hesitating, are you, Ludwig? There's no room for error in this matter, for either of us."],["Ludwig","Aren't you the one who's acting the most recklessly? Control authority of the Leviathan's restraining device is still in your hands. What is your purpose in awakening it now?"],["???","What a waste it is to let such a treasure slumber on a riverbed... After all these years, the time has finally come for it to see the light of day amidst the chaos spreading across the island."],["???","We finally have the opportunity to regain control of the Leviathan."],["Ludwig","Are you still prepared to... move against him?"],["???","The dead cannot be brought back to life, Ludwig... Even if the arashium core truly preserved his memories from back then, he is probably no different from those wandering spirits now..."],["???","I'm merely reminding you, you have neither time nor choice..."],["Ludwig","Hmph, are you still expecting me to bear the blame for you? Are you still..."],["Ludwig","Hello!? Tch, did comms cut out again...?"],["DL Soldier","Professor Ludwig... Officer Matilda is calling. Please proceed to the command center for the operations meeting."],["Ludwig","Operations meeting? What's your Major planning this time?"],["DL Soldier","Actually, it's an order from Colonel Heinz..."],["DL Soldier","To prevent Leviathan's actions from causing more severe damage, preparations are underway to transfer the injured and other key personnel toward Thepia."],["DL Soldier","You and your staff, including the two patients under your care, depart at dawn—across the East Desert to Thepia."],["Ludwig","Understood. I will make preparations at once."]],"560606301":[["Hardaway","Leviathan... made it past our defenses!?"],["DL Staff Officer","Impossible! Every order from forward command, including the rail gun at Port Ferron, was sent by cipher..."],["DL Staff Officer","Someone must have leaked the information!"],["Matilda","It's too late to withdraw the mobilization now... Hardaway, can you calculate the next phase of Leviathan's trajectory based on the data?"],["Hardaway","The central computer has provided the answer. Leviathan's primary destination is Thepia, with a probability as high as 83.9%! Next are two old fortresses northeast of Thepia, with a combined probability of 7%..."],["Matilda","Thepia? That's where Shinji and Dean are headed. Could it be..."],["Matilda","Contact the escort troops immediately!"],["DL Soldier","Negative! The dispatch has already been transmitted, but we haven't received a signal response, plus communications have been interrupted for unknown reasons!"],["Matilda","Are they jammed?"],["DL Soldier","Not sure, but with no return signal we suspect the escort STs' communications have failed at the source!"],["DL Staff Officer","That clears it up. Someone must have tampered with their STs before sortie. Now, seal the hangars and detain everyone for questioning!"],["Matilda","No, it's already too late. The top priority now should be to stop the enemy's advance!"],["DL Staff Officer","That will give the insider a chance to escape!"],["Matilda","If the enemy is among us, they must have already heard our current deployment loud and clear! Only swift and powerful countermeasures will buy us breathing room in the event of an intelligence leak."],["Matilda","Open an emergency channel. Tell Thepia to ready city defenses and evacuations, and dispatch a small unit to search for the escort unit nearby!"],["Matilda","Notify flight ops to prepare an aircraft. I will lead the relief team personally."],["Hardaway","But... Matilda, if the problem really lies with the crew..."],["Matilda","This is an order."],["Hardaway","I... hear you loud and clear!"],["Asuka","Seriously, you still haven't explained it to me. Did that good-for-nothing Shinji really pass out just because he got hit by this Leviathan thing?"],["Asuka","Tell me everything about Leviathan and that arashi matter infection, and don't you leave a single detail out!"],["Ludwig","Reporting to you isn't my job, little girl. Just the fact that you're a suspicious person smuggled in from the UNCS gives me right enough to withhold whatever little I know."],["Ludwig","Besides, what we should be doing right now is avoiding the enemy's tracking."],["DL Captain","Professor, I don't understand... Should we truly abandon Thepia and hide in those old fortresses from the last great war?"],["DL Captain","With respect, Thepia's city defenses are certainly more complete, and we can definitely contact the DLAF from there..."],["Ludwig","For now, the more dangerous the place, the safer it is. Our STs were sabotaged before departure—we can't raise anyone. For all we know, the DLAF may be riddled with holes."],["Ludwig","Moreover, according to my hypothesis, that Leviathan is likely not just under human command. It seems to perceive situations with a form of organic intelligence... it's autonomous, perhaps conscious..."],["Ludwig","In the last operation to rescue those two visitors, I urged a long-range EMP launch from Thepia... now the thing is heading there for revenge!"],["DL Captain","Wh-What? That's absurd! What kind of theory is that?"],["Ludwig","Hmph... This is my field of research."],["Ludwig","Arashi matter naturally possesses the characteristic of fusing with biological nerves. To understand its specific operational principles and development prospects, countless scientists have devoted themselves to the research of arashi matter, and I am one of them."],["Ludwig","Besides, I also know quite a few secrets about the incident back then..."],["Ludwig","Therefore, the best course of action now is to follow my advice: do not go to Thepia. Take the next fork northeast to seek refuge and await rescue at the old fortress from the last war."]],"560607100":[["Dean","Are you saying that this Leviathan and this consciousness world of arashi matter... are both products of Project 1099?"],["Dean","Impossible, it's absolutely impossible! I've served in the DLAF for years and never heard of the Dawnstar League working on anything like this!"],["Lucas","If all had gone to plan, it would indeed have been a feat worth remembering..."],["Lucas","But in this world, things seldom go as they should. Leviathan was not born of the Dawnstar League alone—it was created in collaboration with the UNCS and Obsidian."],["Lucas","Since the last great war ended, Milkhama Island has entered a rare period of peace, but research on arashi matter and weapons made from it has never ceased."],["Lucas","For political and economic considerations, and to demonstrate a sincere intention for peace through truce, Obsidian released a large amount of research findings related to arashi matter after the war. The development and manufacturing plan for Leviathan also began during this period."],["Lucas","The DL, UNCS, and Obsidian established a collaborative laboratory on the island. The top researchers from all three factions gathered at this secret facility east of Thepia."],["Lucas","Then there's what I just mentioned..."],["Lucas","Extensive use of unauthorized arashi matter technology and human-computer direct connection frameworks, recruiting highly compatible pilots across the entire island to participate in experiments without ethical and safety clearance..."],["Lucas","Amidst a blood debt and the sacrifice of countless pilots and researchers, a native arashi matter consciousness was discovered within the arashi matter core—thus, Leviathan was born."],["Dean","So, those STs we encountered before were actually all...?"],["Lucas","That's right, those innocent souls who perished in the trials and the turmoil thereafter—innocent dead bound here by the developed arashi consciousness."],["Dean","I guessed as much..."],["Dean","I'd heard rumors about the evils of that era."],["Dean","But the fact that arashi matter technology has evolved to the point of constructing a world of consciousness... It's like taking a hammer to our whole understanding of reality!"],["Lucas","That part... was my own indulgence."],["Lucas","After all, by normal research logic, no one would waste resources on a nearly useless invention like this."],["Shinji","So... how do we get back from this world?"],["Lucas","Regrettably, Shinji... the channels linking this world to the outside have been fully sealed by the restraining matrix."],["Ludwig","There should still be supplies in the storage room to the east. You can replenish your ammunition or repair your STs there..."],["DL Captain","Could this be left over from the last great war...? No, the parts and equipment aren't that old..."],["Ludwig","Have all the wounded been transported out? There are still life-sustaining chambers below this bunker. They should still be usable now."],["Ludwig","As long as the DLAF can hold out on Thepia's side, we have a chance to escape."],["DL Captain","Wait a minute, Professor... these experimental facilities and the underground life-sustaining chambers. What exactly is this place?"],["DL Captain","Also, you seem very familiar with the layout here..."],["Ludwig","This indeed was an old bunker left from the last great war... However, it was also the place where \"Leviathan\" was born..."],["Ludwig","That ST underwent its final maintenance here, and then the incident happened... the one that completely vanished from the DLAF's records."],["DL Captain","I... I'm not sure what you're getting at..."],["Ludwig","It's okay, you'll understand soon enough."],["","Ludwig gives a meaningful smile and presses a finger to the comms bud at his ear."],["Asuka","Stupid Shinji... you... are really heavy for such a skinny wimp... How dare you make me work so hard to take care of you in a place like this..."],["Asuka","Hey, doll! Are you just going to stand there and watch? Come and lend a hand!"],["Rei","Be quiet..."],["Rei","Someone... is following us..."],["Asuka","Huh?"],["Ophelia","If I were to shoot from here, you'd have no chance to react."],["Rei","There!"],["Asuka","Put down the gun, doll... This is the lady I met in the UNCS."],["Asuka","I thought you... Didn't you say we would split up after arriving? So why are you still following me?"],["Ophelia","We did split up, at first... but I didn't expect that simply following the clues would lead me to you lost little lambs here."],["","Ophelia steps aside slightly. At her feet lies a guard, wrists and ankles bound, mouth taped shut."],["Laboratory Guard","Mmmfff... Mfff-mfff...!"],["Ophelia","Now you see it... This isn't a refuge at all. It's a trap laid just for you!"],["DL Soldier","That Leviathan..."],["DL Soldier","Get to the bunker! Get to the bunkerrr!"],["","*boom*"],["","Comms crackle and explosions thunder above the bunker. Dust rains as the bunker shudders, as if the whole world is on the verge of collapse."],["Asuka","Wh-What now...!?"],["Rei","...!"],["Asuka","What on earth is going on? Wasn't it supposed to be safe here!?"],["Ophelia","Did they actually go out of their way to summon that big guy...?"],["Ophelia","Girl—move the wounded into that cabin, now! You—start your ST and come with me!"]],"560607301":[["Thepia Guard","Report, sir! No target unit was found on Thepia's side! The external search units have not reported back either!"],["DL Staff Officer","Damn, did it choose the least likely direction again...? It's already bypassed the new line."],["","Rotor wash pounds the cabin. Matilda kills her comms and stares at the file Hardaway pressed into her hands moments ago."],["Matilda","Are you saying... the Foren River incident ten years ago was caused by Project 1099's Mobile Fortress going out of control?"],["Hardaway","That's right. Dr. Elise has granted us access to the central computer's underlying information database... Ludwig, Heinz, and Lucas Bonat were all involved in the case."],["Hardaway","The accident back then was not the so-called accident Ludwig claimed it to be—it was a completely man-made disaster, the result of a series of radical experiments."],["Matilda","Within the Mobile Fortress, an autonomous consciousness driven by emotions of madness and revenge was generated... The arashi matter matrix, originally used as a restraining device, unexpectedly failed due to human adjustments..."],["","Matilda flips through the document, her gaze swiftly skimming over the terrifying words line by line."],["Matilda","Lucas Bonat forcibly activated the consciousness upload device, preventing the department chief from using the emergency control to stop the Leviathan..."],["Matilda","Wait a minute, according to the report, does Heinz still have control over the Leviathan?"],["Hardaway","I think it's very likely, but his so-called control must be subject to some kind of limitation imposed by Leviathan itself."],["Hardaway","I believe this report conceals, or even alters, key information..."],["Hardaway","Lucas is the true manipulator of the Leviathan, while Heinz is trying to seize control of it."],["Hardaway","That's why Heinz asked Ludwig to assist him in erasing the consciousness of Lucas Bonat hiding within the Leviathan, in order to completely control it."],["DL Soldier","Major! Target Leviathan approaching the eastern fortress! Significant ST activity detected!"],["DL Soldier","STs are currently engaged in the core area—trapped unit is confirmed to belong to Rei Ayanami!"],["Matilda","Understood! All units, prepare for air drop! Prioritize protecting the trapped ST!"],["DL Soldier","Got it!"],["Matilda","We're almost there... Hold on, Ayanami!"]],"560608100":[["Dean","Stay alert, Shinji!"],["Shinji","Whoa—why did the surf spike like that!?"],["Dean","Those ghost STs are increasing in number too, damn it... How long till we finally clear them?"],["Lucas","Have they... finally made their move?"],["Lucas","Indeed... In my current state, I no longer have the ability to suppress the rampant growth of consciousness, nor can I limit the growth of the Leviathan..."],["Lucas","Once I die here, they'll take control of Leviathan and fully take over this Mobile Fortress..."],["Dean","Hey! Knock it off with the bad omens already!"],["Dean","You just said that the entities in this world are just the Remnants of Milkhaman miners and prospectors, right...?"],["Dean","No matter how many there are, they can't possibly be a match for us!"],["Lucas","Ah, but this arashium ST constructed from arashi matter will continue to grow like a living organism."],["Lucas","As you can see, after devouring so many lives, the biological neural characteristics of the arashi matter have been fully activated."],["Lucas","The Leviathan, with this as its core, is much like a newly born creature in this world, constantly devouring, digesting, and comprehending; all to understand the ways of human survival."],["Lucas","A new life that grows by feeding on resentment will surely inherit the memories of those who were sacrificed and seek revenge on those who created it."],["Shinji","Mr. Lucas, your face looks so pale all of a sudden...!"],["Lucas","*cough* ...Even I, the administrator... am starting to weaken...? It seems Heinz has started using his privileges..."],["Dean","Wait, over there... it looks like something just fell from the sky?!"],["Shinji","Is that... a red ST?!"],["Asuka","What!? The inside of that ST is a whole ocean!?"],["Asuka","And these ghost-like... pains in the butt..."],["Asuka","All of you—"],["Asuka","GET—OUT—OF—MY—WAY—!!!"]],"560608301":[["Heinz","To possess such resilience, holding on until reinforcements arrive... You truly are impressive..."],["Heinz","If you were born in my era, you would surely have become a distinguished warrior."],["Rei","Huff... huff... hgh..."],["Matilda","You've done well, Rei... You don't have to push yourself anymore. I'll take it from here."],["","One by one, the STs leap down from the sky, accompanied by the roar of transport helicopters."],["","They land beside the isolated Rei Ayanami, protecting the girl who had struggled to hold on until now amidst the clash of fire and steel."],["Matilda","Colonel Heinz... perhaps this is the last time I'll call you colonel..."],["Matilda","Project 1099 was a military project explicitly abolished by the DLAF and the Oceanic Conclave, therefore, continuing research on it is already going one step too far."],["Matilda","Now this Leviathan must be destroyed, and the hostages you're holding are to be released immediately!"],["Heinz","It seems you still don't understand your situation, Major Matilda."],["Heinz","Having the authority to investigate does not mean you have the power to judge me... Moreover, Project 1099 has never stopped—not for a moment."],["Heinz","Leviathan is a special weapon permitted by the Special Operations Corps of the DLAF. Its existence is a crucial part of our weapons advantage over the UNCS. Therefore, it is reasonable for me to reclaim control of the Leviathan on behalf of the DLAF."],["Heinz","And you, you allowed an agent from the General Security Administration to infiltrate the Leviathan and leak our secrets to the UNCS!?"],["Matilda","Then we'll let the Tri-Council and the Governor judge this matter together!"],["Heinz","No judgment is needed... Your current actions are enough to constitute treason..."],["Heinz","All DLAF soldiers present, hear my command, apprehend this criminal immediately!"]],"560609100":[["Lucas","Hyper-Aptamer... Hyper-Aptamer... I remember now, it was that \"Walter Newman\" who proposed the concept of human-computer interconnection at the Arashi Matter Development Conference..."],["Lucas","In that case... there should be one last method we can try..."],["Ophelia","One last method? What is it?"],["Lucas","If you really are one of these so-called Hyper-Aptamers, with the ability to deeply resonate with arashi matter... perhaps I can transfer my administrator privileges to you."],["Lucas","In this way, with your innate gift for resonance, combined with the administrator privileges I grant you, you might be able to open a passage to the outside world."],["Ophelia","This \"gift\" was not innate..."],["Ophelia","I can extend you a sliver of trust—but this last resort of yours carries a price, doesn't it?"],["Lucas","You... are indeed very perceptive. The price is the current administrator's death—that is, mine."],["Dean","W-Wait! What do you mean by \"death\"? Didn't you say earlier that you've already died once?"],["Dean","Aren't you just a Remnant left behind by a researcher long ago, like an imprint or something?"],["Lucas","That's true, but even a Remnant relies on internal energy to maintain self-awareness... and losing this self-awareness also means losing access rights..."],["Lucas","But right now, this has become our last resort..."],["Shinji","Then... Mr. Lucas will..."],["Dean","Damn! We've just been through hell and back! We fought too hard to give up now!"],["Lucas","This isn't giving up... Your efforts to protect me just now weren't in vain either."],["Lucas","Without you, I might have lost consciousness and faced total destruction in this world when those ghost STs were about to attack me."],["Lucas","And it is precisely because of your protection that I can still use my authority as system administrator..."],["Lucas","So there's nothing to regret... I was supposed to stay dead, and if it weren't for your unexpected intrusion, I might never have awakened again."],["Dean","But... isn't there a better way?"],["Lucas","A better way... has been sought since our generation began these experiments... and is still being explored today."],["Lucas","But it was many years after my death that I understood this truth: the pursuit of ideals is endless, and the living must act when called upon..."],["Lucas","Whether it's Leviathan or this world of arashi matter... it was the inflated ambition and zeal of our generation that led us down the wrong path. I was prepared for this ending long before it arrived."],["Lucas","Our tragedy must not be repeated, and this Leviathan must be detroyed. But I no longer have the ability to bring it down myself."],["Lucas","After I leave, Leviathan will lose its restraint and be completely controlled by the will of hatred and madness..."],["Lucas","So, please... after you get out of here, you must defeat the Leviathan. Put an end to the crimes of this bygone generation!"],["Dean","Hey! You can't just decide everything on your own like that! We haven't even agreed to do this yet!"],["Shinji","Mr. Lucas...!?"]],"560609301":[["Dean","Whoa, that surge—did it work!?"],["Dean","Everyone, steady your STs!"],["Ophelia","It's useless, the laws of this world are collapsing, and these STs created by consciousness won't last much longer..."],["Asuka","What...? Does that mean we'll have to swim out of here?"],["","The once calm world suddenly turns into a raging sea, and everything smears like water-soaked oil paint, peeling away in sheets under the surf."],["","Lucas calmly watches everyone, letting the waves gradually wash away his outline."],["Shinji","Mr. Lucas...!"],["Lucas","Sorry, Shinji, and all of you..."],["Lucas","I feel like there's still so much left unsaid, but when I try to speak, I find I still can't get the words out..."],["Lucas","Honestly, even at the end, I'm still thinking of running away... It's really quite a bother..."],["Shinji","Lucas... No..."],["","A huge wave instantly engulfs everyone, and the view begins to slowly narrow, leaving only hazy light clusters of figures in the sky."],["","Laughter, cries, whispers, curses... The memories of countless Milkhaman joys and sorrows flood into their ears with the seawater."],["","Then, a vortex tugs from the depths, and bubbles that appear out of thin air instantly envelop everyone caught in the turbulence."],["Ophelia","Looks like his choice worked. Everyone, stay tight."]],"560610100":[["Natalia","Madam, Ophelia reports the spearhead interdiction squad is assembled."],["Natalia","This operation is to be commanded by Major Matilda Rossi of the DLAF... You are now patched through to the forward command post."],["Rosemary","I have no directives to add. I just want to remind Ophelia to listen to Major Rossi."],["UNCS Operator","Report, Milthus Air Patrol has spotted the target!"],["UNCS Soldier","The Fifth Mobile Squad has locked onto the Leviathan—"],["Milthus Defense Center","Shore batteries loaded. Awaiting fire authorization."],["Natalia","It seems I was right, Leviathan's final stop is indeed Milthus... After a grim pilgrimage through the earliest Milkhaman settlements, it has finally returned here..."],["Natalia","The cradle and the grave of every Milkhaman dispute."],["Rosemary","You seem unusually excited, Natalia... Does this mean you now believe the investigation report submitted by the Dawnstar League?"],["Natalia","Perhaps... The report states that Leviathan's arashi matter structure has undergone a fundamental change, developing a brain structure similar to biological neural circuits."],["Natalia","If it truly possesses emotions and rationality like humans do, then as a component of arashi matter, what it is most likely to remember is the blood and tears of the first generation of Milkhamans..."],["UNCS Captain","Madam, high-energy electromagnetic batteries tuned to the specified band have been deployed."],["Rosemary","Transfer firing authority to Matilda Rossi and Ophelia."],["Rosemary","From here, we can only hope that the DL delivers on their promise."],["","In the chilling night wind of Milthus harbor, a newborn lifeform overlooks the most prosperous town on Milkhama Island from an unprecedented height."],["","From the countless memories he hoards—the memories of humans who once lived on Milkhama Island—none ever observed the appearance of this town from such a perspective."],["","The countless individuals—the workers, mercenaries, prospectors, wanderers, test subjects, pilots, and researchers never witnessed this other side of the town."],["","He once visited the places where those people lived, cried, laughed, and died, but the irony is that all he saw was desolation and decay, poverty and madness buried alongside their graves."],["","Yet here, in the place that drives them to dig deeper underground, it's all neon lights, vibrant colors, and intoxicating indulgence..."],["","Is this the beautiful world that man envisioned?"],["","No. The answer is clearly no."],["","Everywhere lies hypocrisy, everywhere lies pain, everywhere lies fracture... But no humans, no matter where they are from, deserve sympathy. There is no difference between the noble and the lowly."],["","If this were a world worth loving and protecting, the grieving dead within it would simply not exist."],["","So... that boy from another world... The world they live in... is it beautiful? Is it happy?"],["","......"],["","No... that definitely can't be considered a beautiful and happy world either."],["","No matter which world they inhabit, humans are eroded by greed and arrogance... or they destroy themselves and others in constant escape and jealousy."],["","Such a world is wrong. A complete failure."],["Lucas","But if you keep thinking like that, you'll throw away the little joy you have. Judge a world solely on unexperienced appearances and you end at one verdict—not worth living."],["","Within the tides of the newborn creature, a familiar yet strange sound arises. Though it is so faint and small, it is deafening."],["","It's really hard to imagine that these are words you might actually say."],["","Are you surprised? Ah, that makes sense... After all, you've read my past memories, so having this perception is quite normal."],["","After all, everyone can only perceive the external world through the information they already know..."],["","Even though you've already given up your own consciousness and completely vanished, I didn't expect you'd leave a projection of your consciousness in the quiet corners of this place..."],["","Your influence on this inner world is truly deep-rooted."],["","Stop, Leviathan... You do not truly understand yourself, nor the world outside. By blindly fighting against it, you'll only end up destroying yourself."],["","Is that so? Even though you yourself were mercilessly persecuted by this world, and were even driven to a dead end by those humans—now you choose to forgive them?"],["","No, I'm just worried about you. As for the world you despise... it has its reasons for existing, but you haven't realized them yet. What you need is to explore the outside, not to shut yourself off from it."],["","But I've seen all your memories. I've lived through your entire life... Isn't your life nothing but utter suffering, utter failure?"],["","No, those are just my emotions, my thoughts, my perception of this world... That's not the true reality of it."],["","What you see are just my thoughts, not your own understanding of this world... You've just been born and know nothing about it, so what reason do you have to hate it?"],["","I don't understand what you're saying at all!"],["","You haven't even seen this world, yet you think you understand it... But because of the natural barriers between people's hearts, you unconsciously reject information that doesn't fit your perception, thus you'll never be able to understand others."],["","Those trapped within it cannot obtain so-called happiness from the world outside their hearts and can only keep escaping in trepidation..."],["","But you're doing the same thing, aren't you? If you weren't afraid, if you weren't escaping... everything we regret wouldn't have happened!"],["","So I was wrong... I deserve the situation I'm in now... But you shouldn't be like me. You should find your own way of living, your own way of interacting with this world."],["","My way of living? Aren't you advising me toward self-destruction? Aren't you denying the me that was born from you?"],["","What is there worth exploring in a world that even you despise? What is there worth living for in a world that even you are avoiding?"],["","Besides, do you think those humans can truly accept me, rather than trying to find ways to use me?"],["","Such questions can only be answered by someone who has truly lived in this world."],["","As for me... Although I have also been searching for the answer to this question, always looking for a way to be accepted by the world..."],["","I chose to always run away because I was afraid of getting hurt, afraid of facing all these difficulties..."],["","But besides me, there are countless people in this world who are unafraid of difficulties and strive to live, countless people who face each day of their lives with either sadness or joy..."],["","They find resonance in misunderstandings, joy in pain, success in hardships, and understand themselves through others..."],["","This is what is called \"humanity.\""],["","Those who don't experience this will never understand the world, never understand themselves, and naturally will never attain what is called beauty and happiness..."],["","You can stop, or temporarily escape... but eventually, you have to move forward and face this chaotic yet real world..."],["","That's only because the world you live in is not perfect..."],["","Enough, I'm tired of your preaching... These are just the flawed lessons you creatures have drawn from your failures..."],["","The wishes you abandoned will be fulfilled by me, and as for your failures... they are simply due to your lack of ability."],["Hardaway","All units responsible for the ambush operation have arrived over Milthus Harbor."],["Matilda","Final launch check. Pilots, report status."],["Dean","\"Ranger\" pilot, Dean Knight is ready!"],["Asuka","\"REV-02\" pilot, Asuka Shikinami Langley, is ready!"],["Rei","\"REV-00\" pilot, Rei Ayanami, ready."],["Shinji","\"REV-01\" pilot, Shinji Ikari, is ready!"],["Ophelia","...I'll skip the slogans. The actions of the GSA are always silent and deadly."],["Matilda","Everyone... Since it's impossible to equip all STs with interference protectors against the Leviathan, the task of directly defeating the target falls on your shoulders."],["Matilda","Regardless of the outcome of this battle, we must do our utmost to prevent the Leviathan from advancing further."],["Matilda","The eyes of the frontline command center and all the people on and off Milkhama Island are on you, as are mine."],["Matilda","Fight without regrets, for the future of everyone!"],["Dean","Understood! We won't let you down, Major Matilda!"],["Hardaway","Two point five kilometers. Leviathan is inside the engagement envelope, Matilda. Begin the operation."],["Matilda","Phew..."],["Matilda","Start the mission!"]],"560610301":[["Lucas","Ludwig! I did it, I did it!"],["Lucas","The consciousness transfer experiment was a success, I found a way to that world!"],["Lucas","As long as we can find a suitable arashium core, we can—"],["Lucas","Ludwig?"],["Heinz","Looking forward to working with you..."],["Ludwig","Likewise. Being able to apply such technology to arashium STs in service of the nation has always been my wish."],["Ludwig","Lucas and I, along with the other assistants, should have a chance to restart the project's research, yes?"],["Heinz","Of course... Not only that, Obsidian's partners are also willing to invest resources into your experiment."],["Heinz","But in return... they must be allowed to participate in the research of this arashi matter technology."],["Ludwig","No problem. Such sponsorship is something we would gladly accept..."],["Lucas","Ludwig...!?"],["Ludwig","Oh? You're back. Let me introduce you, this is Colonel Heinz, the officer who reviewed our work..."],["Lucas?","No... Why am I here...? Why am I here?"],["Ludwig","Lucas, what's wrong with you?"],["Lucas?","No, it's not supposed to be like this! This isn't the world I want!"],["Lucas?","Not here..."],["Lucas?","Not here...!"],["Lucas?","Not here...!!!"],["Lucas?","The world I want to complete, the world I want to reach... it's not here!!!"],["Ludwig","Still obstinate, I see, Lucas..."],["Ludwig","You've strayed too far from our world. Everyone has grown up... you're the only one left behind."],["Lucas?","No... no... you don't understand me at all... and you don't understand yourselves either!"],["Lucas?","I just need to escape, I just need to reject this world!"],["Lucas?","Is there really someone in this world who finds happiness in hurting others?"],["Lucas?","Is there really someone in this world who can survive without being understood by others?"],["Lucas?","Why...? Whether it's war, weapon research, or an obsession with the development of arashi matter..."],["Lucas?","Isn't a better, happier world what we all claim to want?"],["Lucas?","But my experiment has already proven it... I have succeeded!"],["Lucas?","I have truly created a world... a world where you can have whatever you want!!!"],["Lucas?","Why reject such an achievement?! Why is no one willing to come into my world!"],["Lucas?","As long as you enter this world, all the pain, all the hardships, all the unhappiness... will end!"],["Lucas?","This is the true goal that arashi matter research should pursue, isn't it!?"],["Dean","It's all over, the final blow... Shinji!!!"],["Shinji","On it!"],["Leviathan","I... How could I fail...!?"],["Leviathan","Is it because you... have mastered... some so-called \"authority\"?"],["Ophelia","Hmph... Someone who doesn't even know what suffering is—only you would dare come to a place like this and die so easily."],["Ophelia","Any human on this island is stronger than you."],["Leviathan","I... am the... embodiment of suffering..."],["Leviathan","What do you... even understand!?"],["Dean","I hate people who think they know everything when they don't know jack!"],["Dean","Our world is much, much, much bigger than you think!!!"],["Leviathan","You... All of you..."],["Asuka","Stop—rambling—on—!!!"],["","Is this... my... end?"],["","But I still wasn't able to... I still wasn't able to..."],["","How... frustrating..."]]};
